                            <div class="faq-answer" style="max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.2s ease-out; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.5;">
                                <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; padding-bottom: 10px;">
                                    Binance Futures settlements occur every 8 hours (00:00, 08:00, and 16:00 UTC / 07:00, 15:00, and 23:00 WIB). During these times, traders holding Long positions pay funding fees to traders holding Short positions (or vice versa, depending on the funding rate polarity). Our bot shorts the Futures leg to collect these payments passively 3 times a day.
