                        <div class="faq-item" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 12px 0;">
                            <button class="faq-question" style="background: transparent; border: none; width: 100%; text-align: left; font-size: 1.05em; font-weight: bold; color: var(--text-primary); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 5px 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
                                <span>Q: Why is there a small cash buffer left (e.g. $2.00 free cash)?</span>
                                <span class="faq-icon" style="transition: transform 0.2s; font-size: 0.8em; color: var(--accent-blue);">▼</span>
