                            <div class="faq-answer" style="max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.2s ease-out; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.5;">
                                <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; padding-bottom: 10px;">
                                    The bot operates with fixed position sizes ($60 per koin for Retail). The remaining cash acts as a buffer to cover exchange trading fees and absorb temporary margin fluctuations on the Futures leg, protecting the account from execution failures or margin calls.
